Read the complete review to distinguish detection, diagnosis, prognosis, data handling and maintenance decisions. Follow selected primary references for the chosen mechanism and compare them with later evidence; statements about the field's maturity describe the paper's time.

Publication information and selected evaluation/best-practice passages were inspected on 30 October 2026. The PDF states Springer copyright outside the USA. NIST hosting does not imply a general Creative Commons adaptation licence for the entire article. Preserve the external copy and describe missing raw data, implementation or service evidence when attempting to reproduce a cited result.

